WEBVTT

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:01.776
to protect against LGBT discrimination.

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:03.016
Here's Bhumika:

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:04.776
(Video) BS: What I'm most proud of?

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:06.296
I'm a transgendered person.

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:08.096
I'm so proud of my life.

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:11.856
On December 21, 2007,

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:15.536
the supreme court gave the decision
for the Nepal government

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:18.296
to give transgender identity cards

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:20.256
and same-sex marriage.

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:23.576
LD: I can appreciate
Bhumika's confidence on a daily basis.

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:26.496
Something as simple
as using a public restroom

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:29.056
can be a huge challenge
when you don't fit in

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:32.136
to people's strict gender expectations.